# docmap has NO runtime secrets and NO datastore (see PRODUCT.md#Architecture).
# The only secret in this project is used at publish time (Plan M4, via /deploy).
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and replace the placeholder. Placeholders are rejected by name.

# Visual Studio Marketplace personal access token for `vsce publish`.
# Generate: https://dev.azure.com → User settings → Personal access tokens → scope "Marketplace (Manage)".
VSCE_PAT=CHANGE_ME__VSCE_PAT__CHANGE_ME

# Open VSX access token for `ovsx publish` (Cursor, VSCodium and other VS Code builds install from Open VSX).
# Generate: https://open-vsx.org → sign in with GitHub → Settings → Access Tokens (and create the `kish21` namespace).
OVSX_PAT=CHANGE_ME__OVSX_PAT__CHANGE_ME

# TEST_DATABASE_URL: N/A — no datastore exists, so there is nothing to isolate.
